            "title": "Did Alstom's (ENXTPA:ALO) New CEO Appointment Signal a Strategic Shift for the Company?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Alstom\u2019s Board of Directors has selected Martin Sion to become the company\u2019s new Chief Executive Officer, effective April 1, 2026, succeeding Henri Poupart-Lafarge who has served since 2016 and will remain in his position to ensure a smooth transition. This leadership change introduces an executive with extensive aerospace and industrial experience, marking a significant shift as Alstom continues to pursue growth and operational improvement. With Martin Sion\u2019s appointment as incoming CEO,...",
